 "notes": "On run 2026-10-18T01-30-48_qwen36-gpu1_cdb1 the loop guard raised a cycle note every six turns from turn 93 through 213 while the bedroom clock adjustment was open. Each note briefed the field. The stall briefing already quotes the controls the game shows; this switch makes the loop guard's own note do the same. Also ON in the bundle arm of experiments/fixed/bundle-v-control.json and OFF in its control arm. Incumbent is the clock-view-loop incumbent, which has loop-guard-supervisor-v1 on, because this switch needs it; only loop-guard-screen-v1 is flipped. Activation is NEW_GAME_CREATED (the naming screen is the first ready interface). Primary is CLOCK_SET, the progress the field notes delayed on that run. Not designed (pokebench-experiment-design) and not queued. source.commit is main bcde8cd4 before this branch; repin it to the merge SHA with `just experiment-pin` after landing."
